# Windows Server Administration Project (MCSA)

## 📌 Overview
This project demonstrates a virtual Windows Server environment built using VMware Workstation for training purposes.

## 🖥️ Environment
- VMware Workstation
- Windows Server
- Windows Client Machines

## ⚙️ Features

- Active Directory Domain Services (AD DS)
- User and Group Management
- Organizational Units (OUs)
- Group Policy Objects (GPO)
- DNS Configuration
- DHCP Service
- File Sharing & Permissions
- Domain Join for Client Machines

## 🧪 Testing
- Clients successfully joined to the domain
- Users and policies applied correctly
- Network services working properly

## 🎯 Purpose
This project simulates a real enterprise Windows Server environment for IT administration training (MCSA level).

